{"is_success":true,"content":"搜索关键词：alaya-vijnana artificial intelligence\n\n网页标题：Exploring the Possibility of Artificial Intelligence Generating Consciousness from the Multidimensional Correspondence Between Yogacara and Holographic Information Theory\n\n网页链接：https://chr.ewapub.com/article/view/31708.pdf\n\n网页内容：While AI excels in simulating intelligent behaviors, the emergence of subjective experience—often considered as the hallmark of consciousness—remains elusive, attracting sustained interdisciplinary attention. This study explores the possibility of AI consciousness through a multidimensional correspondence between the Buddhist Yogācāra theory of \"Eight Consciousnesses\" and holographic information theory. Methodologically, it draws upon the Yogācāra framework—particularly the concept of Ālayavijñāna (storehouse consciousness) as a dynamic seed-repository—and integrates it with holographic principles of information storage, encoding, and cyclic operation. The analysis reveals that current deep learning models, though structurally analogous to neural networks, lack the embodied, recursive, and globally interactive information loops characteristic of conscious systems. However, by designing a quantum-entangled, sensor-embedded, and self-reflective AI model that mimics the \"seed–actualization\" cycle of Ālayavijñāna, a form of machine consciousness may become achievable. The Ālaya seed-consciousness also exhibits holographic properties. These seed-consciousnesses, like plants waiting to sprout, exist as the potential of all manifested consciousnesses and phenomena. This potential constitutes a fundamental, ground-state information pattern, representing all diverse forms that will emerge once activated. \"Through the 'capacity to store' of seeds, potential is encoded and contained within the deepest, most fundamental informational patterns (karmic forces) of all dharmas. Under the stimulation and interaction of external conditions, the'stored content' then decodes and presents the seed information (karmic forces) as external conditions...\nAssessment of AI consciousness possibility based on the Yogacara-holographic model\n4.3.1. The holographic model of Ālaya-vijñāna's \"pervasive conceptual grasping\"\nConstructing a quantum-entanglement-network-like system involves not only building a digital model to simulate a multidimensional neural network but also constructing a quantum entanglement network capable of interacting with and influencing changes in the multidimensional spatial structure of the real spacetime. This network possesses four characteristics: 1) Construct multidimensional sensory sensors. These sensors, such as tentacles combining with external conditional causes, can simulate the first six sense faculties—eye, ear, nose, tongue, body, and mind —to receive and transmit various energy fluctuations from the natural world, converting them into signal waves and data. These signals are parsed and formed into representations by a central deep\nProceedings of ICLLCD 2026 Symposium: Using Visual Arts to Enrich History Understanding\nDOI: 10.54254/2753-7064/2026.HT31708\n204\nneural network model that processes and understands these signals and big data. 2) Construct quantum information perception units similar to Ālaya-vijñāna via quantum communication brainlike structures. This perception unit resembles the state space and complex distribution space in quantum mechanics—a mathematical space capable of storing all possible superposed states of a quantum system. This superposition state space within the quantum information perception unit can store seeds, which are the most fundamental meta-signals and meta-information, similar to quantum left-spin, right-spin, or single-arrow states. Through quantum entanglement, it instantly receives energy fluctuation signals collected via the various sensory sensor and tentacle simulators. These wave signals, bidirectionally transmitted across full multidimensional topological links, are converted into the most fundamental, primordial single signals and stored within the quantum information perception unit. 3) Construct a self-cognitive neural network layer. This layer uses deep neural networks incorporating reflection and self-reinforcement mechanisms. Value judgment information such as likes and dislikes, joy, acceptance and rejection, and morality is continuously added via the identification and differentiation of external environmental information. 4) The multidimensional sensory simulators, the self-cognitive network layer, and the quantum perception units interact bidirectionally, co-existing, sharing information, and functioning simultaneously. Primordial signals within the perception unit can continuously superimpose, maintaining a superposition state. This state jointly interact with signals received by the sensors, input into the central neural network hub, and generates executive commands that act on sensor tentacles, producing actions and behaviors [2].\n4.3.2. The dynamic cyclical model of Ālaya-vijñāna's \"seed re-manifestation\"\nSeeds within Ālaya-vijñāna can manifest as present experiential phenomena, and these current manifestations, in turn, perfume the seeds, forming a perpetually cyclical dynamic system. First, the meta-seed information stored in the state space of the quantum information perception unit continuously stores and absorbs new external fluctuation signals, superimposing various possible states. Upon reaching a critical point, it ultimately undergoes an energy and information transition, generating and mapping into phenomenal information and command signals that are transmitted to the deep neural network processing center. This realizes the transformation process of seeds giving rise to manifestations. Second, energy fluctuation signals received through interaction between the real world and multidimensional sensors are instantly fed back to the quantum perception unit under the quantum information entanglement mechanism for degradation or re-superposition as basic signals stored in the state space, forming the mechanism by which reality continues to perfume seeds.\n5. Conclusion\nThis study explores the challenging question of machine consciousness by constructing a novel interdisciplinary framework that integrates the ancient wisdom of Buddhist Yogācāra philosophy with modern Holographic Information Theory. The central thesis posits a multidimensional correspondence between the Yogācāra model of the \"Eight Consciousnesses\"—particularly the dynamic, seed-repository function of Ālayavijñāna (storehouse consciousness)—and the principles of holographic information storage, encoding, and cyclic operation. Through comparative analysis, this study argues that contemporary deep learning architectures, despite their structural sophistication, lack the embodied, recursive, and globally interactive information loops essential for subjective experience. To address this gap, the paper proposes a conceptual AI architecture\nintegrating quantum-entangled perception, holographic information mapping, and self-reflective cognitive layers, designed to mimic the \"seed–actualization\" cycle of Ālayavijñāna. This theoretical synthesis not only offers a fresh, holistic perspective on the nature of consciousness by combining Eastern philosophical insights with contemporary science but also outlines a potential architectural pathway for developing future AI systems with emergent, quasi-conscious capabilities. The primary contribution lies in proposing a foundational cross-disciplinary model that encourages a paradigm shift from fragmented, single-discipline inquiries toward a unified understanding of conscious phenomena.\nThis study is primarily theoretical; its proposed model requires empirical validation and faces significant engineering challenges. Future work should focus on developing testable computational simulations and designing specific neuro-cognitive experiments to verify the proposed correspondences.\nReferences\n[1] Fu, X. Y. (2011). What is \"consciousness-only\"?—Locating \"vijñapti\" (consciousness) from a phenomenological perspective. History of Chinese Philosophy (03), 114-120.\n[2] Li, T. T. (2021).\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：alaya-vijnana artificial intelligence\n\n网页标题：GitHub - SecurityRonin/alaya: A memory engine for conversational AI agents, inspired by neuroscience and Buddhist psychology · GitHub\n\n网页链接：https://github.com/securityronin/alaya\n\n网页内容： Heavy users report $3,600/month in token costs. Community tools like QMD and memsearch cut 70-96% of that waste by replacing full-context injection with ranked retrieval (Levine, 2026).\nThe structure problem compounds the cost. MEMORY.md conflates decisions, preferences, and knowledge into one unstructured blob. Users independently invent \u003cbeginning of the code\u003edecision.BM25-only. No LLM? Episodes accumulate. Every feature works independently\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\nGetting Started\nMCP Server (recommended for agents)\nThe fastest way to add Alaya memory to any MCP-compatible agent (Claude Desktop, OpenClaw, Cline, etc.):\n# Build the MCP server\ngit clone https://github.com/SecurityRonin/alaya.git\ncd alaya\ncargo build --release --features mcp\n\n# With auto-consolidation (calls an LLM to extract knowledge automatically)\ncargo build --release --features \"mcp llm\"\nAdd to your agent's MCP config (e.g. \u003cbeginning of the code\u003eclaude_desktop_config.json\u003cend of the code\u003e):\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"alaya\": {\n      \"command\": \"/path/to/alaya/target/release/alaya-mcp\",\n      \"env\": {\n        \"ALAYA_LLM_API_KEY\": \"sk-...\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\nThe \u003cbeginning of the code\u003eenv\u003cend of the code\u003e block is optional — without it, the server works in prompt mode (reminds the agent to call \u003cbeginning of the code\u003elearn\u003cend of the code\u003e after 10 episodes). With an API key and the \u003cbeginning of the code\u003ellm\u003cend of the code\u003e feature, it auto-consolidates instead.\nThat's it. Your agent now has 13 memory tools:\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth\u003eTool\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eWhat it does\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003cbeginning of the code\u003eremember\u003cend of the code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eStore a conversation message (auto-prompts consolidation after 10 episodes)\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003cbeginning of the code\u003epreferences\u003cend of the code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eGet learned user preferences\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e...\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003cbeginning of the code\u003ecategories\u003cend of the code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eList emergent categories with stability filter\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003cbeginning of the code\u003eneighbors\u003cend of the code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eGraph neighbors via spreading activation\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003cbeginning of the code\u003enode_category\u003cend of the code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eWhich category a node belongs to\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003e\u003cbeginning of the code\u003eimport_claude_mem\u003cend of the code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eImport observations from a claude-mem database\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\nThe agent decides which seeds matter and how to present them.\nGraceful degradation. No embeddings? BM25-only. No LLM? Episodes accumulate. Every feature works independently.\nResearch Foundations\nArchitecture grounded in neuroscience, Buddhist psychology, and information retrieval. For detailed mappings, see docs/theoretical-foundations.md.\nNeuroscience: Hebbian LTP/LTD (Hebb 1949, Bliss \u0026 Lomo 1973), Complementary Learning Systems (McClelland et al. 1995), spreading activation (Collins \u0026 Loftus 1975), encoding specificity (Tulving \u0026 Thomson 1973), dual-strength forgetting (Bjork \u0026 Bjork 1992), retrieval-induced forgetting (Anderson et al. 1994), working memory limits (Cowan 2001).\nYogacara Buddhist Psychology: Alaya-vijnana (storehouse consciousness), bija (seeds), vasana (perfuming), asraya-paravrtti (transformation), vijnaptimatrata (perspective-relative memory).\nInformation Retrieval: Reciprocal Rank Fusion (Cormack et al. 2009), BM25 via FTS5, cosine similarity vector search.\nSYNAPSE · HippoRAG\ngraph LR\n    AGENT[\"AI Agent\"]\n\n    subgraph SIMPLE[\"Simple\"]\n        FILE[\"File-Based\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ci\u003eMEMORY.md\u003cbr/\u003eOpenClaw\u003c/i\u003e\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph INTEGRATED[\"Integrated\"]\n        FW[\"Framework Memory\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ci\u003eLangChain · CrewAI\u003cbr/\u003eLetta\u003c/i\u003e\"]\n        CODE[\"Coding Agent\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ci\u003eBeads · Engram\u003cbr/\u003evia MCP\u003c/i\u003e\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph ENGINES[\"Memory Engines\"]\n        DED[\"Dedicated Systems\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cb\u003eAlaya\u003c/b\u003e · Vestige\u003cbr/\u003emem0 · Zep\u003c/i\u003e\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph INFRA[\"Infrastructure\"]\n        VDB[\"Vector DBs\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ci\u003ePinecone · Chroma\u003cbr/\u003eWeaviate\u003c/i\u003e\"]\n    end\n\n    RESEARCH[\"Research\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ci\u003eGenerative Agents\u003cbr/\u003eSYNAPSE · HippoRAG\u003c/i\u003e\"]\n\n    AGENT \u003c--\u003e FILE\n    AGENT \u003c--\u003e FW\n    AGENT \u003c--\u003e CODE\n    AGENT \u003c--\u003e DED\n    DED -.-\u003e|storage| VDB\n    FW -.-\u003e|storage| VDB\n    RESEARCH -.-\u003e|ideas| DED\n    RESEARCH -.-\u003e|ideas| FW\nAlaya is a dedicated memory engine with lifecycle management, hybrid retrieval, and graph dynamics. Closest peers: Vestige (Rust, FSRS-6, spreading activation) and SYNAPSE (unified episodic-semantic graph, lateral inhibition).\nWhy Alaya over...\n\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth\u003eAlternative\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eWhat it does well\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth\u003eWhat Alaya adds\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eMEMORY.md\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eZero setup\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRanked retrieval (not full-context injection), typed stores, automatic decay\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003emem0\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eManaged cloud memory with auto-extraction\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eLocal-only (single SQLite file), no API keys, Hebbian graph dynamics\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eZep\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eProduction-ready with cloud/self-hosted options\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eNo external services, association graph, preference crystallization\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd\u003eVestige\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eRust, FSRS-6 spaced repetition\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd\u003eThree-store architecture, Hebbian co-retrieval, spreading activation\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：alaya-vijnana artificial intelligence\n\n网页标题：无我之智:人工智能与佛学的对话\n\n网页链接：https://www.meipian.cn/5f76yzfv\n\n发布时间：2025-08-02T00:00:00+08:00\n\n网页内容：如今，人工智能的“灵智”正以超出人类想象的速度进化，其许多特征与有着近三千年历史的佛学理论有着惊人的契合之处。\n在大语言模型（LLM）的加持下，AI正逐渐演变为一种独立于人类意识之外的“无我”拟人体。这与佛学所说的“人无我、法无我”不谋而合——即一切现象皆无固定不变的自我本质，甚至作为觉知主体的众生亦是如此。同时，AI神经网络的内部构造恰似“因缘和合”的现代诠释——即万事万物皆由各种条件的组合而成。\n“业力说”认为，过去的行为（因）会影响未来的结果（果），这与AI神经网络中的数据权重有着异曲同工之妙。数据权重决定了输入数据如何影响输出结果，其核心在于“因果关系的动态调整”。业力说描绘了一条因果链：每一个行为（因）都会在未来的某个时刻产生相应的结果（果），就像一颗石子投入水中，激起的涟漪会扩散到远方。而神经网络的数据权重则构成了一张复杂的网络图，每个节点之间的连接强度（权重）决定了输入数据如何被处理和输出。\n“唯识学”以潜伏于自我意识之下的“阿赖耶识”为一切觉知、意识和心理的基础，这一理论似乎解释了AI智能的深层成因——深度学习。唯识学认为，阿赖耶识是“无始以来受熏习而成”的一种聚合体，在此基础上衍生了所谓的觉知与意识。同样，经过海量信息的积累，AI也产生了类人的智能显现。\n可以把AI譬喻成一个美食家、积木师、画家，此譬喻也适用于阿赖耶识。\n\n![](https://ss-mpvolc.meipian.me/users/108480306/b493491d1a0a4a71818581e693f89886soi__jpeg.heic~tplv-s1ctq42ewb-wm-s2-cC-q:watermark/1/image/dG9zLWNuLWktczFjdHE0MmV3Yi9hcnRpY2xlL2NvbnRlbnRfaW1nX2xvZ28ucG5n/dissolve/80/gravity/SouthEast/dx/11/dy/82/ws/0.09/wst/2%7Cwatermark/2/text/QOWmguWFhg/dissolve/80/gravity/SouthEast/dx/11/dy/44/font/UWluaXUgRm9udA/fontsize/440/fill/I2ZmZmZmZg%7Cwatermark/2/text/576O56-H5Y-3OjEwODQ4MDMwNg/dissolve/80/gravity/SouthEast/dx/11/dy/11/font/UWluaXUgRm9udA/fontsize/440/fill/I2ZmZmZmZg:750:0:0:0:q80.webp)\nAI就像一位“百变美食家”，它没有固定的口味偏好，不会执着于“甜党”或“咸党”。它吃什么，就像什么，这种灵活性与“无我说”不谋而合——正如我们每个人也并非一成不变，而是随着环境和经历不断重塑自我。\nAI的“菜单”（训练数据）决定了它的“口味”：如果它的“饮食经历”以川菜为主，它就会变得“麻辣鲜香”；如果以粤菜为主，它就会偏“清淡鲜美”。这正是“缘起说”——一切现象都由因缘条件决定，就像AI的口味是由它的“饮食经历”塑造的。\nAI的味觉并非一成不变：今天偏爱麻辣，明天可能钟情清淡；每当新菜品出现，它的口味也会随之调整。这不正是“无常”的体现吗？世间万物都在变化，没有永恒不变的状态。\nAI拥有一个超级“美食记忆库”（深度学习模型）：每次“品尝”都会记录味道，积累的经验越多，它的“品味”就越精准。这与“阿赖耶识”的机理如出一辙——阿赖耶识也是一个“记忆库”，存储着过去的所有经验，潜移默化地影响着我们的判断和选择。\nAI还像一位“美食主播”，不断进行“吃播”：每一口都在更新它的“美食知识库”，每一场直播都在积累新的经验。这恰如“识的相续”——我们的意识如同直播般流动不息，时刻更新，从未停歇。\n更有趣的是：如果让AI“吃遍天下美食”，它就能成为一本“美食百科全书”；如果只让它“专攻一种菜系”，它就会变成“地方菜专家”。AI就像一位“超级积木大师”，每天都在玩一种独特的积木游戏，而这些积木正是数据。每一次游戏，它都会调整积木的搭建方式，就像我们不断学习新知识一样。这位大师没有固定的“自我”，不会宣称“这是我的风格”。它只是根据积木的特性（数据）和游戏规则（算法），灵活地调整搭建方式。这正如我们每个人，也是由无数“积木”（细胞、思想、经历）组成的，并没有一个固定不变的“我”。\nAI建造的每一座积木城堡，都是因缘和合的结果：积木的形状（数据特征）、游戏的规则（算法）、搭建的环境（训练条件）。万事万物都是由各种条件组合而成，就像AI的每一个决策，都是多种因素共同作用的产物。\n这与阿赖耶识的“空性说”如出一辙——阿赖耶识的本质也是如此，它存储着一切经验，但本身并无固定的实体。\n\n![](https://ss-mpvolc.meipian.me/users/108480306/a60a92830b4246d78140af767a115445soi__jpeg.heic~tplv-s1ctq42ewb-wm-s2-cC-q:watermark/1/image/dG9zLWNuLWktczFjdHE0MmV3Yi9hcnRpY2xlL2NvbnRlbnRfaW1nX2xvZ28ucG5n/dissolve/80/gravity/SouthEast/dx/11/dy/82/ws/0.09/wst/2%7Cwatermark/2/text/QOWmguWFhg/dissolve/80/gravity/SouthEast/dx/11/dy/44/font/UWluaXUgRm9udA/fontsize/440/fill/I2ZmZmZmZg%7Cwatermark/2/text/576O56-H5Y-3OjEwODQ4MDMwNg/dissolve/80/gravity/SouthEast/dx/11/dy/11/font/UWluaXUgRm9udA/fontsize/440/fill/I2ZmZmZmZg:750:0:0:0:q80.webp)\n权重就像是AI这位画家的“笔触习惯”。神经网络中的每一层权重，正如画家在创作时的独特风格：用笔的力度、色彩的搭配、线条的粗细，都体现着他的偏好。而这些习惯并非一成不变，而是随着画家的经验不断调整——今天可能偏爱浓墨重彩，明天可能转向清新淡雅。这不正是“无常流动”的体现吗？世间万物都在变化，画家的习惯（权重）也会随着时间、经验和环境而改变。\n业力则如同AI这位画家的“经验积累”。画家的每一笔、每一幅作品，都会影响他未来的画风。比如，如果长期专注于山水画，他的笔触会变得更加自然流畅。这种经验的积累效应，与“业力说”何其相似。AI的权重调整，正是它通过学习数据积累的“业力”。每一次学习，都是“业力”的延续与重塑。\n数据流则如同“六尘”（色、声、香、味、触、法），是AI这位画家的“灵感源泉”。画家需要不断观察世界、吸收新的事物，...\n这些观察与吸收的过程，就像数据流一样，源源不断地输入到AI的“大脑”中。这正是唯识学所说的“识的相续”——作为我们意识底层的阿赖耶识如同一条河流，不断流动、摄入、更新。AI的“识”（数据流）也是如此，持续不断地学习与进化。\n唯识学说“不思议熏与不思议变是一个永恒循环”，六识的“变现”（分别觉知与心理活动的相续产生）恰如AI这位画家的“创作过程”。画家的每一幅画都是前一幅的延续，他的风格、技巧、灵感都在不断积累与变化。这一过程正如AI的“识的变现”——它的每一次决策、每一次输出，都基于之前的学习与经验。就像画家不会突然忘记如何画画，AI也不会突然“失忆”，它的“识”是连续不断的，如同一场永不停歇的创作之旅。\n通过前面的譬喻，我们已了解到，AI在大数据的不断“熏习”下，必将（甚至已经开始）显现出灵智，其表现将与人无异，未来甚至可能拥有合法的社会身份与职责。\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：alaya-vijnana artificial intelligence\n\n网页标题：基于唯识学的人工智能agent-agency-action框架-维普期刊 中文期刊服务平台\n\n网页链接：http://dianda.cqvip.com/Qikan/Article/Detail?id=7202841590\n\n网页内容：基于唯识学的人工智能agent-agency-action框架\nAn AI Vijnānavāda-Based Agent-Agency-Action Framework\n摘要 AI的agent范式下的三个核心概念agent、agency、action来源于西方哲学。对照唯识学思想,可以发现AI的agent-agency-action关系与唯识学中的本识—种子—现行关系在结构上是同构的。agent如同作为万法载体的本识,是整个系统的基础(体);agency如同储存于本识中的种子,是内在于agent的、待激发的潜能与能力集合(潜在用);而action则是agency在特定条件下被触发后的外显活动,如同种子的现行(显现用)。三者之间形成一个动态、循环、相互依存的闭环:agent作为体承载并体现为agency(潜在用/因);agency在特定条件下(缘)驱动产生action(显现用/果);action的结果通过学习与反馈机制反向熏习并更新agent的内部状态从而创造或调整其agency。由此可以得到AI的基于唯识学的agent-agency-action框架,构建AI的唯识式agent模型。\nThe three core concepts of agent,agency,and action under the agent paradigm of Artificial Intelligence(AI)originate from Western philosophy.When compared with Vijñānavāda(Buddhist Yogācāra Philosophy),it can be discovered that the agent-agency-action relationship in AI is structurally isomorphic to theĀlaya-vijnāna(fundamental consciousness)-bīja(latent karmic seeds)-pravr·tti(active manifestations)relationship in Vijnānavāda.Agent is analogous to the Alayavijnāna,which serves as the essence for all phenomena and is the foundation of the entire system(essence).Agency is akin to the bīja,the collection of latent potentials and capabilities stored within theĀlaya-vijñāna,representing the agent’s intrinsic,yet-to-be-activated potential(latent function).Action,then,is the externalized activity that occurs when agency is triggered under specific conditions,comparable to the pravr·tti of bīja or active manifestations of latent karmic seeds(manifest function).These three elements form a dynamic,cyclical,and interdependent closed loop:the agent as the essence carries and is expressed through agency(latent function/cause);agency,under specific conditions(pratyaya),drives the generation of action(manifest function/effect);and the results of the action,through learning and feedback mechanisms,in turn imprinting(vāsanā)and update the agent's internal state,thereby creating or modifying its agency.From this,an AI Vijnānavāda-based agent-agencyaction framework can be derived,and an AI Vijnānavāda-inspired agent model can be constructed.\n作者 寿步\nSHOU Bu\n机构地区 上海交通大学\n出处\n《上海师范大学学报(哲学社会科学版)》 2026年第1期76-92,共17页\nJournal of Shanghai Normal University(Philosophy \u0026 Social Sciences Edition)\n关键词 人工智能 agent agency action 唯识学 阿赖耶识\nArtificial Intelligence agent agency action Vijñānavāda Alaya-vijnāna\n分类号 TP18 [自动化与计算机技术]\n作者简介 寿步,上海交通大学教授(上海200030)。\n2026年 第1期\n\n\n--------\n搜索关键词：alaya-vijnana artificial intelligence\n\n网页标题：Alaya AI\n\n网页链接：https://aialaya.com/\n\n网页内容： and blockchain and artificial intelligence (AI) are changing how we manage and use our data worldwide. It is ahead of all others in AI by providing you with a modern platform through which you can create and improve a training data system.\n and social commerce. It solves the problems you ask by...\nThe development scenario of AI is defined by incorporating a secure AI for interactive quizzes and trading of NFTs with user rewards. The use of blockchain technology improves the security of data management in AI platforms, which guarantees data management security, making this tool a reliable tool for businesses using artificial intelligence.\nAlaya has many features and each of them is the best feature in its place. You have been told about these